  ["It's opposite the church.", "Het is tegenover de kerk."], ["It's on the corner.", "Het is op de hoek."], ["Is it far?", "Is het ver?"]]},

 {"type": "h1", "text": "6. In de les"},
 {"type": "verbpairs", "title": "Handig in de les", "items": [
  ["What does this word mean?", "Wat betekent dit woord?"], ["How do you say ... in English?", "Hoe zeg je ... in het Engels?"],
  ["Can you speak more slowly, please?", "Kunt u langzamer praten, alstublieft?"], ["I don't understand.", "Ik begrijp het niet."],
  ["Can you write it down?", "Kunt u het opschrijven?"], ["I don't know.", "Ik weet het niet."]]},

 {"type": "h1", "text": "7. Zelftoets"},
 {"type": "p", "text": "Vul het ontbrekende woord in. De antwoorden staan op de laatste pagina."},
 {"type": "exercises", "items": [
  {"q": "A coffee, ______.", "hint": "alsjeblieft (verzoek)", "a": "please", "full": "A coffee, please."},
  {"q": "Here you ______. — Thank you.", "hint": "alsjeblieft (bij geven)", "a": "are", "full": "Here you are. — Thank you."},
  {"q": "My mother's sister is my ______.", "hint": "familie", "a": "aunt", "full": "My mother's sister is my aunt."},
  {"q": "My brother's son is my ______.", "hint": "familie", "a": "nephew", "full": "My brother's son is my nephew."},
  {"q": "It's half past ______.", "hint": "het is half acht", "a": "seven", "full": "It's half past seven."},
  {"q": "It's quarter ______ eight.", "hint": "kwart voor acht: past of to", "a": "to", "full": "It's quarter to eight."},
  {"q": "The day after Tuesday is ______.", "hint": "woensdag", "a": "Wednesday", "full": "The day after Tuesday is Wednesday."},
  {"q": "How much ______ it?", "hint": "to be", "a": "is", "full": "How much is it?"},
  {"q": "Turn ______ at the church.", "hint": "linksaf", "a": "left", "full": "Turn left at the church."},
  {"q": "What does this word ______?", "hint": "betekenen", "a": "mean", "full": "What does this word mean?"},
  {"q": "Can I pay by ______?", "hint": "pinnen", "a": "card", "full": "Can I pay by card?"},
  {"q": "Nice to ______ you.", "hint": "ontmoeten", "a": "meet", "full": "Nice to meet you."}]},
 {"type": "p", "text": "<b>Vertaal in het Engels:</b>"},
 {"type": "translations", "items": [
  {"q": "Hoeveel kost het?", "a": "How much is it?"},
  {"q": "Ik begrijp het niet.", "a": "I don't understand."},
  {"q": "Pardon, waar is het station?", "a": "Excuse me, where is the station?"},
  {"q": "De rekening, alstublieft.", "a": "The bill, please."}]},
